{{#is_alert}}
## Cyberhaven Incident -- {{@cyberhaven.incident.id.name}}

A Cyberhaven incident log was ingested or updated.

- **Incident ID**: `{{@cyberhaven.incident.id.name}}`
- **Last modified**: `{{@cyberhaven.incident.last_modified.name}}`

This monitor is grouped by `@cyberhaven.incident.id` and `@cyberhaven.incident.last_modified`, so it fires once per distinct version of each Cyberhaven incident: once when it is created and again on every update. The paired workflow looks the incident up in Datadog by the `source_incident_id` custom field, then creates it if missing or updates it if it exists.

If no Datadog incident was created or updated, confirm that the `cyberhaven-create-update-incident` workflow is imported, published, and enabled.

@workflow-cyberhaven-create-update-incident
{{/is_alert}}
